el pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">?$/studs</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$38/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$42/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><b>Gold</b> can spawn in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Lightslate\" title=\"Lightslate\">Lightslate</a></b>, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Beigeslate\" title=\"Beigeslate\">Beigeslate</a></b>, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Darkslate\" title=\"Darkslate\">Darkslate</a></b>, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Limestone\" title=\"Limestone\">Limestone</a></b>, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Blackstone\" title=\"Blackstone\">Blackstone</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lavaslate\" title=\"Lavaslate\">Lavaslate</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Prismarine\" title=\"Prismarine\">Prismarine</a> and very rarely <a href=\"/wiki/Sandstone\" title=\"Sandstone\">Sandstone</a></b> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Ores\" title=\"Category:Ores\">nodes</a></b>.   \n</p><p>Note: <b>Gold will not spawn in <a href=\"/wiki/Marble\" title=\"Marble\">Marble</a> deposits as of update 1.67.0.</b>   \n</p><p>The raw form of <b>Gold</b> takes on a darker yellow color that <b>could</b> be easily mistaken for <b><a href=\"/wiki/Pyrite\" title=\"Pyrite\">Pyrite</a></b>.   \n</p><p>Putting <b>Gold</b> in a <b>refinery</b> raises the sell price to <b>$38/stud</b>. Putting that <b>refined</b> <b>Gold</b> through a <b>forge</b> further increases the price to <b>$42/stud</b>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>During testing, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Pyrite\" title=\"Pyrite\">Pyrite</a></b> and <b>Gold</b> were nearly indistinguishable, as <b>all</b> of the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Ores\" title=\"Category:Ores\">ores</a></b> at that time did <b>not</b> have special node meshes.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Ore_Nav\" title=\"Template:Ore Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Ore_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Ore_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\">